# lawn_fence_bed_spine.cam — lawn_fence_bed_offset.cam with `pattern=spine` (Phase 30;
# DECISIONS.md → "Phase 30 slice 2: mow…", its name until Phase 35). Two wall chains that END mid-side:
# each gets a shore pass that stops where its wall stops and never wraps the
# end of the chain, because past it the boundary is free.
#
# lawn_fence_bed_offset.cam — a curated lawn (Phase 29 slice 2; DECISIONS.md → "Phase
# 29 slice 2…").
#
#   road (south) and driveway (east)   OPEN   — run off and reposition
#   fence (north)                      WALL   — never violated
#   flowerbed (west, half-round)       WALL   — bulges into the lawn
#
# The bed does NOT cover the whole west side: an open gap runs above it, between
# the bed and the fence, and another below it, down to the road. So a WALL CHAIN
# TERMINATES MID-SIDE, twice — the case where a wall-following pass must not
# wrap round the end of the chain, because past its end the boundary is free.
units mm
feed 800
plunge 300
rapid_z 5
clearance_z 25
spindle 3000
stock Box(w=140, l=100, h=20, x=0, y=0, z=0)
tool T5 Endmill(dia=10.0)

# The lawn: road to the south and driveway to the east are OPEN — the mower may
# run off and reposition. The fence to the north is CLOSED. The flowerbed
# bulges in from the west and does NOT cover that side: open gaps run above it
# (bed to fence) and below it (bed to road), so a wall chain TERMINATES
# MID-SIDE, twice.
feature Lawn Face(z=-4
    loop
    10.000 10.000
    130.000 10.000
    130.000 90.000
    10.000 90.000
    10.000 65.000
    13.882 64.489
    17.500 62.990
    20.607 60.607
    22.990 57.500
    24.489 53.882
    25.000 50.000
    24.489 46.118
    22.990 42.500
    20.607 39.393
    17.500 37.010
    13.882 35.511
    10.000 35.000
)
feature Fence ProfileBoss(extent=4
    10.000 100.000
    130.000 100.000
    130.000 90.000
    10.000 90.000
)
feature Bed ProfileBoss(extent=4
    10.000 65.000
    13.882 64.489
    17.500 62.990
    20.607 60.607
    22.990 57.500
    24.489 53.882
    25.000 50.000
    24.489 46.118
    22.990 42.500
    20.607 39.393
    17.500 37.010
    13.882 35.511
    10.000 35.000
)
run End(tool=T5, surface=Lawn, stepover=5.0, pattern=spine)
